      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can't recommend taking Advil without consulting your doctor, especially considering your existing heart medication. However, a normal dose of Advil such as 200mg or 400mg is unlikely to cause an immediate problem, especially if taken occasionaly like one night. If you do take it, monitor your stomach and watch for any unusual side effects, such as nausea or bleeding. However, I strongly advise you to consult your doctor as soon as possible to discuss a suitable pain management plan.",
